{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlassess\/timeonly"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAssess"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAssess\/timeOnly","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeOnly"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLTimeOnly","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeOnly","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLTimeOnlya"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"time-only"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restricts the assessment to a set of times through a repeated section."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeOnly"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLTimeOnlya","text":"MXLTimeOnly"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLAssessV8timeOnlySaySiGSgvp","title":"timeOnly","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAssess":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, an assessment application should assess all notes without a cue child element, and not assess any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"note with a cue child element. The assess type allows this default assessment to be overridden for individual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notes. The optional player and time-only attributes restrict the type to apply to a single player or set of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"times through a repeated section, respectively. If missing, the type applies to all players or all times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through the repeated section, respectively. The player attribute references the id attribute of a player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element defined within the matching score-part."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlassess","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAssess"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLAssess","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAssess"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAssess","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAssess/timeOnly":{"title":"timeOnly","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeOnly"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLTimeOnlya","text":"MXLTimeOnly"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlassess\/timeonly","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAssess\/timeOnly","abstract":[{"text":"Restricts the assessment to a set of times through a repeated section.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTimeOnly":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeOnly","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeOnly"}],"type":"topic","title":"MXLTimeOnly","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimeonly","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time-only type is used to indicate that a particular playback- or listening-related element only applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"particular times through a repeated section. The value is a list of positive integers arranged in ascending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, indicating which times through the repeated section that the element applies."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeOnly"}]}}}